      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781893028522,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Non-functional requirements\n-- Deliver with low-latency < 500ms\n-- Gurantee delivery of message\n-- Scaling to billion users, high throughput\n-- Message not stored unncessarily\n-- Fault-tolerant\n------\n-- exhautive treatment of security concerns.\n-- Spam and scraping prevention systems",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Non-functional requirements\n-- Deliver with low-latency < 500ms\n-- Gurantee delivery of message\n-- Scaling to billion users, high throughput\n-- Message not stored unncessarily\n-- Fault-tolerant\n------\n-- exhautive treatment of security concerns.\n-- Spam and scraping prevention systems",
