      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781893028522,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "-- Chatapp require high-frequency update for both sent & received, we \ncould use websocket (bidirectional socket connection) -- over TLS for \nsecurity will be used.\n// --> createChat\n{participant: [], name: \"\"} - response: {chatId: \"\"}\n// --> sendMessage\n{chatId: \"\", message: \"\", attachment: []...} \n-- response: {status: SUCCESS|FAILURE, messageId: \"\"}\n// --> createAttachment\n{body: \"\", hash: \"\"} -- response: {attachmentId: \"\"}\n// --> modifyChatParticipant\n{chatId: \"\", userId: \"\", operation: ADD|REMOVE}\n--> SUCCESS|FAILURE\n\n// <- chatUpdate\n{\n    \"chatId\": \"\",\n    \"participants\": [],\n} -> \"RECEIVED\"\n\n// <- newMessage\n{\n    \"chatId\": \"\",\n    \"userId\": \"\"\n    \"message\": \"\",\n    \"attachments\": []\n} -> \"RECEIVED\"",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "-- Chatapp require high-frequency update for both sent & received, we \ncould use websocket (bidirectional socket connection) -- over TLS for \nsecurity will be used.\n// --> createChat\n{participant: [], name: \"\"} - response: {chatId: \"\"}\n// --> sendMessage\n{chatId: \"\", message: \"\", attachment: []...} \n-- response: {status: SUCCESS|FAILURE, messageId: \"\"}\n// --> createAttachment\n{body: \"\", hash: \"\"} -- response: {attachmentId: \"\"}\n// --> modifyChatParticipant\n{chatId: \"\", userId: \"\", operation: ADD|REMOVE}\n--> SUCCESS|FAILURE\n\n// <- chatUpdate\n{\n    \"chatId\": \"\",\n    \"participants\": [],\n} -> \"RECEIVED\"\n\n// <- newMessage\n{\n    \"chatId\": \"\",\n    \"userId\": \"\"\n    \"message\": \"\",\n    \"attachments\": []\n} -> \"RECEIVED\"",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
