    {
      "id": "RZhyqms-U_KCisjupF8HN",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1714.9556254484519,
      "y": 2459.955340433566,
      "width": 676.0794677734375,
      "height": 300,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b6E",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 419453259,
      "version": 91,
      "versionNonce": 2063390885,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781893028522,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "The difference here with Kafka is that Pub/Sub is not managing \nstorage of messages. Kafka requires significant disk-based overhead \nper topic (in addition to the messages themselves) since it persists \nmessages to disk and maintains consumer offsets. \nRedis Pub/Sub channels are much lighter — \nthey're essentially in-memory pointers to subscriber connections \nwith no message persistence. \nThat said, we wouldn't run all our pub/sub through\n a single Redis instance. In practice, \nwe'd shard across a cluster of Redis instances \n(partitioning channels by user ID), \nwith each instance handling a fraction of the total channels.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "The difference here with Kafka is that Pub/Sub is not managing \nstorage of messages. Kafka requires significant disk-based overhead \nper topic (in addition to the messages themselves) since it persists \nmessages to disk and maintains consumer offsets. \nRedis Pub/Sub channels are much lighter — \nthey're essentially in-memory pointers to subscriber connections \nwith no message persistence. \nThat said, we wouldn't run all our pub/sub through\n a single Redis instance. In practice, \nwe'd shard across a cluster of Redis instances \n(partitioning channels by user ID), \nwith each instance handling a fraction of the total channels.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "y61v3QhBHgdaGde7A0NgX",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 971.9878372855406,
      "y": 2978.159162179739,
      "width": 199.53985595703125,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b6F",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 704570187,
      "version": 24,
      "versionNonce": 1649815595,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781893028522,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "How pubsub will work",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "How pubsub will work",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "9lAxCe7kRVSlDo9VOfiBD",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1185.89130497001,
      "y": 2974.29343686014,
      "width": 8,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b6G",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1364766955,
      "version": 5,
      "versionNonce": 1598758085,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781831302642,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "wnw6aBdl7_8qXEOq_37aF",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 976.9810658233558,
      "y": 3012.9506900561287,
      "width": 1052.3992919921875,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b6H",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 369590693,
      "version": 523,
      "versionNonce": 964983813,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781893028523,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "On connection\n1. User connect to chatserver, chatserver will connect to pubSub to subscribe to the topic for that userId\n2. any message received on that subscription are forwarded onto the websocket connection to that user\nWhen message needs to be sent\n1. Publish message to Pub/Sub topic for userId\n2. message is received by all subscribing chat servers\n3. Chat server then forward the message to user's websocket connection\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "On connection\n1. User connect to chatserver, chatserver will connect to pubSub to subscribe to the topic for that userId\n2. any message received on that subscription are forwarded onto the websocket connection to that user\nWhen message needs to be sent\n1. Publish message to Pub/Sub topic for userId\n2. message is received by all subscribing chat servers\n3. Chat server then forward the message to user's websocket connection\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "LtLB11wGlGzsPmDcM1hP0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 983.736018139634,
      "y": 3219.1931760525385,
      "width": 1168.619140625,
      "height": 275,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b6I",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1960223019,
      "version": 425,
      "versionNonce": 1813312203,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781893028523,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "*** Pub/Sub is \"at most once\" which means it doesn't guarantee delivery. \nIf there's no subscribers listening or Redis has a transient failure, \nthat message is lost.\nThis is acceptable because we write to the Inbox and Message tables before publishing to Pub/Sub. The write path is:\n1. Write message to Message table + create Inbox entries (durable)\n2. Return success to sender\n3. Publish to Pub/Sub for real-time delivery (best-effort)\nIf step 3 fails, the message is still durably stored. \nRecipients will receive it when they reconnect \n(via the Inbox sync described above) \nor through periodic polling for connected clients that missed a pub/sub message.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "*** Pub/Sub is \"at most once\" which means it doesn't guarantee delivery. \nIf there's no subscribers listening or Redis has a transient failure, \nthat message is lost.\nThis is acceptable because we write to the Inbox and Message tables before publishing to Pub/Sub. The write path is:\n1. Write message to Message table + create Inbox entries (durable)\n2. Return success to sender\n3. Publish to Pub/Sub for real-time delivery (best-effort)\nIf step 3 fails, the message is still durably stored. \nRecipients will receive it when they reconnect \n(via the Inbox sync described above) \nor through periodic polling for connected clients that missed a pub/sub message.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "PjtOElW8L0rafcmzTOIUW",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1725.2786785431877,
      "y": 2836.3481529481537,
      "width": 584.2395629882812,
      "height": 150,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b6J",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1583809157,
      "version": 562,
      "versionNonce": 1107342181,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781893028523,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "*** Handle multiple client for given user\n- New \"Clients\" table to keep track of clients by user_id\n- When user participate in chat, need to look up all clients\nfor that user\n- Update Inbox per clientId (view message per client)\n- No change needs in pubsub, continue to subscribe to topic",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "*** Handle multiple client for given user\n- New \"Clients\" table to keep track of clients by user_id\n- When user participate in chat, need to look up all clients\nfor that user\n- Update Inbox per clientId (view message per client)\n- No change needs in pubsub, continue to subscribe to topic",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "UGbF6m2xbW1jEY_IF1j0U",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 985.437054528706,
      "y": 3502.583679364499,
      "width": 784.7394409179688,
      "height": 375,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b6K",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 814484165,
      "version": 959,
      "versionNonce": 1646420331,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781893028523,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "*** what happens if WebSocket connection fails?\nOption1: \n-- when chat server deliver message over websockt, it waits for ACK from client.\nIf ACK does not arrive, server retries delivery. \n-- After few retries, it will assume Websocket is broken and close it \n(similar to server-side timeout to detect when Websocket has silently failed)\n-- this only detects failure when we're actively send message. we won't notice\nconnection dies during idle time\nOption2: (Heartbeat)\n-- Send periodic ping message over websocket, client has to respond,\notherwise, server closes the connections\n-- Heartbeats add overhead, give guranteed upper bound on detect time.\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "*** what happens if WebSocket connection fails?\nOption1: \n-- when chat server deliver message over websockt, it waits for ACK from client.\nIf ACK does not arrive, server retries delivery. \n-- After few retries, it will assume Websocket is broken and close it \n(similar to server-side timeout to detect when Websocket has silently failed)\n-- this only detects failure when we're actively send message. we won't notice\nconnection dies during idle time\nOption2: (Heartbeat)\n-- Send periodic ping message over websocket, client has to respond,\notherwise, server closes the connections\n-- Heartbeats add overhead, give guranteed upper bound on detect time.\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "eyqdU-79IVzmxIYdWKaXU",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 954.4215959888629,
      "y": 3832.9850330704276,
      "width": 787.6993408203125,
      "height": 200,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b6L",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 506027461,
      "version": 483,
      "versionNonce": 280952517,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781893028523,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "*** What if Redis fail??\nCombine heartbeat with sequence numbers\n1. Global sequence per user: maintain single increment counter per user.\nevery message to that user increment their sequence\n2. Include sequence in heartbeat: when server send ping, include sequence number\n3. Client detect gaps: if client local sequence behind server's ==> request sync\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "*** What if Redis fail??\nCombine heartbeat with sequence numbers\n1. Global sequence per user: maintain single increment counter per user.\nevery message to that user increment their sequence\n2. Include sequence in heartbeat: when server send ping, include sequence number\n3. Client detect gaps: if client local sequence behind server's ==> request sync\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "HTfT3zHk_92xuiy6mBA_h",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 932.7834006792664,
      "y": 3986.075264885823,
      "width": 513.7196655273438,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b6M",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1723810987,
      "version": 21,
      "versionNonce": 499710987,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781893028523,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "==> \n1. heartbeats detect dead WebSocket connections, \n2. sequence numbers on to detect missed messages, \n3. and periodic polling serves as a final backstop.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "==> \n1. heartbeats detect dead WebSocket connections, \n2. sequence numbers on to detect missed messages, \n3. and periodic polling serves as a final backstop.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "aArxX9US4Qyi42U2GVu6t",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 920.882393258988,
      "y": 4076.9556851861284,
      "width": 526.1796264648438,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b6N",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1913920965,
      "version": 60,
      "versionNonce": 1012719141,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781893028523,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\nFor chat app, don't handle out of sync message order\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\nFor chat app, don't handle out of sync message order\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Xbp6bX7dQrHDp_d_0QxOS",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 800.2494544079871,
      "y": 4152.689368769716,
      "width": 624.1395263671875,
      "height": 450,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b6O",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 99092779,
      "version": 71,
      "versionNonce": 1795375787,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1781893028523,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "** Getting user last seen\n1. The client publishes a getLastSeen message \nwith their targetUserId and the requestingUserId.\n2. The Chat Server receives the message. In parallel, it will: \n2a) Check the LastSeen table for the targetUserId \nand publish a updateLastSeen message to the Pub/Sub channel \nfor the requestingUserId. \n2b) Forward a getLastSeen message to the \nPub/Sub channel for the targetUserId.\n3) If the target user's Chat Server receives the getLastSeen \nand the user is connected, it will publish an updateLastSeen\n message with lastSeen of \"ONLINE\" to the Pub/Sub \nchannel for the requestingUserId.\n4) Finally, the client will merge the responses. \nIf it receives an ONLINE message, the bubble is green.\n If it doesn't, it will show when the user\n last disconnected from the service.\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "** Getting user last seen\n1. The client publishes a getLastSeen message \nwith their targetUserId and the requestingUserId.\n2. The Chat Server receives the message. In parallel, it will: \n2a) Check the LastSeen table for the targetUserId \nand publish a updateLastSeen message to the Pub/Sub channel \nfor the requestingUserId. \n2b) Forward a getLastSeen message to the \nPub/Sub channel for the targetUserId.\n3) If the target user's Chat Server receives the getLastSeen \nand the user is connected, it will publish an updateLastSeen\n message with lastSeen of \"ONLINE\" to the Pub/Sub \nchannel for the requestingUserId.\n4) Finally, the client will merge the responses. \nIf it receives an ONLINE message, the bubble is green.\n If it doesn't, it will show when the user\n last disconnected from the service.\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Foy85QDJfDWOtPBwW-5Tc",
